'''Tiger the Party Animal''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that spawns during Themed [[Community Events|Community Event]] Parties. Currently there are only three types of Themed Parties: Luaus, [[Community Events#Pet Party|Pet Parties]], and Winter Holiday Parties.

Currently, Tiger is a [[Merchants|merchant]] as of August 27, 2013. He can be found in [[Blackspore Swamp|Blackspore]], [[Sanctuary]], and [[Seaside]] where he sells [[Luau Party Ticket]]s.

==[[Quests]]==
*Quest:A Luau <small>(repeatable)</small>
*Quest:Party for Pets <small>(repeatable)</small>
*Quest:Winter Party <small>(repeatable)</small>

==Parties==
===Luau===
Referees host a Luau themed party during the summer season in a variety of [[Locations|locations]]. During these parties, Tiger will offer the [[Quest:A Luau|A Luau]] [[Quests|quest]] to players.

===Pet Party===
Referees host Pet Parties several times a month in a variety of locations, during these parties, Tiger will offer the [[Quest:Party for Pets|Party for Pets]] quest to players.

